{
  "note": "Ivory's sound palette, from Chase's audition on 2026-10-31. tier default plays in any edit; tier special plays only when he asks for it in a note or a plan. maybe marks a sound he has not fully approved. Files are slices of a hand-vetted library. target_db is the slice's level against speech, measured the way tools/sound_mix.py measures it: 250 ms RMS from the attack, against the 90th percentile of the voice's 20 ms level. Levels were swept in steps and these read the same as reference A's bed-free reels on the same stem measurement (about 3.6 hits per 30 s at -29 dB). The whole source recordings do not ship, so source_dir only matters for re-slicing (sound_mix.py slices). es- entries are code-made sounds from the earshot bank that Chase said yes to on 2026-11-02 (earshot-picks.json). Their source files are in templates/ivory/sfx/earshot/, they carry no target_db, and they are levelled by job like every cue.",
